			</p>
			<p>
				Author: <a href="https://www.giuseppebosi.com/en/">Prof. Giuseppe Bosi</a> (<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/giuseppebosi">LinkedIn</a>) · More courses (in Italian):
				<a href="https://corso-api-json.giuseppebosi.com/">JSON &amp; API</a> ·
				<a href="https://corso-llamacpp.giuseppebosi.com/">llama.cpp</a> ·
				<a href="https://corso-rag.giuseppebosi.com/">Build your own AI memory (RAG)</a>
				· <a href="https://github.com/JoeBosi/claude-code-course">Source code on GitHub</a>
